          "type": "text",
          "value": "Technology is never a substitute for careful clinical judgement, but the right tools help us see more, plan precisely and explain your oral health more clearly. At Precision Dental, we invest in technology that supports accurate diagnosis, efficient treatment and a more comfortable experience."
